abstract: "SAALONOVA is a browser-based statistical analysis tool for balanced agricultural field experiments, supporting CRD, RBD, split-plot, strip-plot and split-split-plot designs, year-wise ANOVA, homogeneity testing, pooled ANOVA, standard errors, critical differences and mean separation."
keywords:
  - agricultural statistics
  - ANOVA
  - experimental design
  - split-plot
  - strip-plot
  - split-split-plot
  - pooled analysis
  - mean separation
  - agronomy
  - agricultural experiments
